&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;To learn more about Discord’s Data Platform,&amp;nbsp;read our engineering blog, including &lt;a href=&quot;https://discord.com/blog/how-discord-uses-open-source-tools-for-scalable-data-orchestration-transformation&quot;&gt;how we built our modern data stack leveraging open-source tools!&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
